/-- **Local axiom (test-only; in no statement's trust base): `runtime`'s untranslated `init` functions return.**
Goose translates them names only; Go runs them at program start and they return (the kit's programs start). -/
axiom localInitFuncsOk :
    ∀ f ∈ ([init.«0», init.«1», init.«2», init.«3», init.«4», init.«5», init.«6», init.«7», init.«8»] : List GoString),
    {{ (True : IProp GF) }} (App (Val (@! f)) (Val #())) {{ RET #(); True }}

end runtime
