namespace runtime

/-- **Local axiom (test-only; in no statement's trust base; unused by the walk): the program runs on Linux.** `runtime.GOOS` is the constant
`"linux"` (Go's `GOOS` of the build; goose translates `runtime` names-only, so it is an
axiom `val` with no value). Satisfiable: `GOOS` is an uninterpreted constant. -/
axiom local_GOOS_linux [GooseExts] [GoGlobalContext] :
    _root_.Perennial.runtime.GOOS = #(go!"linux")

/-- **Local axiom (test-only; in no statement's trust base; unused by the walk): the program runs on amd64.** `runtime.GOARCH` is the constant
`"amd64"` (Go's `GOARCH` of the build; an axiom `val` with no value, as `GOOS`). Satisfiable:
`GOARCH` is an uninterpreted constant. -/
axiom local_GOARCH_amd64 [GooseExts] [GoGlobalContext] :
    _root_.Perennial.runtime.GOARCH = #(go!"amd64")

end runtime

